.TH "HTMLANCHORELEMENT.DOWNLOAD" "3JS" "October 13, 2026" "JavaScript" "JavaScript Reference Manual"
.SH NAME
HTMLAnchorElement.download \- HTMLAnchorElement: download property
.SH SYNOPSIS
The \f[B]\f[CB]download\f[B]\f[R] property of the
\f[CR]HTMLAnchorElement\f[R] interface is a string indicating that the
linked resource is intended to be downloaded rather than displayed in
the browser.
The value, if any, represents the proposed name of the file.
It reflects the \f[CR]download\f[R] attribute of the \f[CR]<a>\f[R]
element.
.PP
See the HTML \f[CR]<a>\f[R] element reference for details about the
attribute.
.SH VALUE
A string.
.SH SEE ALSO
.IP \(bu 2
HTML \f[CR]download\f[R] attribute
